ture","address":"河川景観 / 河成段丘","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"03506","municipality_pref":"岩手県","municipality_name":"九戸村","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"602"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[141.41319274902344,40.24660873413086]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"瀬月内川段丘(2)","category":"nature","address":"河川景観 / 河成段丘","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"03506","municipality_pref":"岩手県","municipality_name":"九戸村","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"602"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[141.42593383789062,40.164703369140625]}}],"display_comment_original":"九戸村周辺には、近世村の記憶として戸田村、山根村、伊保内村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、川向III遺跡、田代遺跡、道地III遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、戸田村、山根村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の由緒を示す歴史案内板も見つかるかもしれない。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":["九戸政実"],"notable_people":["九戸政実"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":[],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":["戦国武将九戸政実 : 九戸政実公没後四百年記念 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/bibnl-94022941","戦国武将九戸政実 : 九戸政実公没後四百年記念 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/dignl-13308542","九戸政実再考 : ふるさとの歴史 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/bibnl-94022937"],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B9%9D%E6%88%B8%E6%9D%91","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q10878859","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E4%B9%9D%E6%88%B8%E6%94%BF%E5%AE%9F&keyword=%E4%B9%9D%E6%88%B8%E6%9D%91"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"九戸村","wikipedia_revision_id":"110163445","wikidata_qid":"Q1205734","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B9%9D%E6%88%B8%E6%9D%91","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E4%B9%9D%E6%88%B8%E6%94%BF%E5%AE%9F&keyword=%E4%B9%9D%E6%88%B8%E6%9D%91","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}